rks inside code strings; line is an integer or null, never an approximate numeric literal. Always provide separate exact evidence strings. Validation fixtures are isolated checks and must never be patched. There are exactly 112 manifest entries, inclusive indices 0 through 111. Full coverage, only after actual review, is [[0,111]]. Copy manifest_sha256 cba45850603317587e4d1e18efadd6c7d1fcde7f959cf5da47b5467c16717079 exactly.","includeWorkflowData":false,"inputFields":{"mode":"review","repo":"Glace678/3","commit_sha":"9df569bd3fca816abbd6947966937152d28cad87","issue_title":"[review] 全仓代码分析：逐文件审查找出bug并输出详细中文报告（只分析不修改）","issue_body":"模式: review\n\n请对整个仓库的全部文本源码（包括第三方与生成代码）做完整审查，逐文件分析，找出 bug、安全隐患、逻辑错误、空指针/越界、资源泄漏、并发问题与潜在缺陷。\n\n要求：\n- 固定当前 main 源码快照，覆盖全部文本文件，覆盖不全不得标记完成；二进制文件仅登记；\n- 只做分析，不修改业务代码；输出详细中文报告，每条问题给出 文件、行号、严重程度、问题描述 与 精确证据原文；\n- 产出草稿 PR 仅承载分析报告，不自动合并；\n- 报告使用中文。","manifest_json":"[{\"file\":\"validation-fixtures/overflow.c\",\"start_line\":1,\"end_line\":3,\"start_char\":0,\"end_char\":126,\"sha256\":\"f89bbbe3bb2d313b0fc6d814f93c77a73a5a8d7314b85586f3bb45a460f4ee22\",\"encoding\":\"utf-8\",\"block_ids\":[\"27ke\"]},{\"file\":\"MuMain/src/ThirdParty/gl4es/src/gl/listdraw.c\",\"sha256\":\"d16507ab9d64a1f10137679b40e7498f32c6108b393b45be398fef6118b8b6aa\",\"encoding\":\"utf-8\",\"start_char\":0,\"start_line\":1,\"block_ids\":[\"1dl8\",\"1dl9\",\"1dla\",\"1dlb\",\"1dlc\",\"1dld\",\"1dle\",\"1dlf\",\"1dlg\",\"1dlh\",\"1dli\",\"1dlj\",\"1dlk\",\"1dll\",\"1dlm\",\"1dln\",\"1dlo\",\"1dlp\",\"1dlq\",\"1dlr\",\"1dls\",\"1dlt\",\"1dlu\",\"1dlv\",\"1dlw\",\"1dlx\",\"1dly\",\"1dlz\",\"1dm0\",\"1dm1\",\"1dm2\"],\"end_char\":38811,\"end_line\":864},{\"file\":\"MuMain/src/ThirdParty/SDL/test/gamepad_face_axby.h\",\"sha256\":\"9e809ed5ab6a21326d1433086cc820e41e983294020876e1997cdeb7e0816469\",\"encoding\":\"utf-8\",\"start_char\":0,\"start_line\":1,\"block_ids\":[\"fw5\",\"fw6\",\"fw7\",\"fw8\",\"fw9\",\"fwa\",\"fwb\"],\"end_char\":12629,\"end_line\":173},{\"file\":\"OpenMU/sr